      w: smoothness\n\t\t\t\tnointerpolation float4 builtInInterpolants : TEXCOORD1;\n\t\t\t\t#endif\n\t\t\t\t#if
      USE_FLIPBOOK_MOTIONVECTORS\n\t\t\t\t// x: motion vector scale u\n\t\t\t\t//
